 "page_md": "**Howe Construction Ltd.**\n5538, Suite 300 Jasper Avenue, Vancouver, BC V8Z 5V4\nTel. 418-831-2398 · vdavid@gilbert.info\n\n# **DAILY FIELD REPORT**\n\n**Project:** Distribution Warehouse - Kingston (9134-940)\n\n**Report No.:** 345\n\n**Date:** 2025-03-20\n\n**Day:** Thu\n\n**Superintendent:** Frances Weber\n\n**Weather AM / PM:** Clear / Sunny\n\n**Temp. low / high:** -7 °C / -4 °C\n\n**Wind / Precip.:** 45 km/h / 2 mm\n\n**Manpower**\n\n| Trade | Company | Workers | Hours | Location |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Crane operator | Craig Mechanical Ltd. | 2 | 16 | roof B |\n| Apprentice | Grant Mechanical Ltd. | 8 | 60 | corridor 2 |\n| Painter | Davis & Sons Contracting Inc. | 3 | 30 | L2 east |\n| Cement finisher | Lopez Mechanical Ltd. | 4 | 32 | footings |\n| Plumber | Trevino Builders Inc. | 12 | 120 | footings |\n| TOTAL |  | 29 | 258 |  |\n\n**Equipment**\n\n| Equipment | Qty | Hours |  | Remarks |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|  |  | Working | Idle |  |\n| Plate compactor | 3 | 6 | 8 | subcontractor |\n| Welding machine | 2 | 0 | 0 | owned |\n| Generator 20 kW | 1 | 8 | 8 | rented - Lou-Tec |\n| Excavator CAT 320 | 1 | 4 | 8 | rented - Lou-Tec |\n\n## **Work performed**\n\nBackfill and compaction north side, 300 mm lifts, density\n\ntests passed 98%. Storm sewer MH-4 to MH-5 installed.\n\nErected structural steel columns C3-C9 level 2. Bolting\n\nand plumbing ongoing. Crane on site 06:30-15:00. Drywall\n\nboarding corridors 201-215, taping started room 204.\n\nPainter prepping level 3.\n\n**Deliveries:** Hollow metal frames, 22 pcs\n\n**Visitors / Inspections:** CNESST inspector - no notices issued\n\n**Delays:** Waiting on RFI-27 response for footing F7\n\n**Safety:** ☑ Toolbox talk held □ Incident / near miss □ First aid □ Site inspection done\n\nPrepared by: Barry Baker Wesley Grant, Superintendent Reviewed by:\n\nHowe Construction Ltd. Daily report - 2025-03-20",
